  "context": "Add a read-only reporting query layer and canonical team status output in human and JSON forms. Select the latest accepted attempt deterministically, summarize cleanup by resource status, and separate outcomes from blockers and approvals. Decision gate: stop if report generation triggers reconciliation mutations, external cleanup, database migration, unbounded artifact inclusion, or secret-bearing subprocess output.",
